t reduction actions has materially improved our operating leverage and the earnings power of WES as reflected in our first quarter results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/wes-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WES 2026 Q3","e":"wes","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Oscar Brown","x":"We have now achieved just over $125 million of permanent O&M and G&A cost savings from the legacy business when excluding Aris, Brazos and utility costs, which are mostly reimbursable.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/western-midstream-wes-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WES 2026 Q3","e":"wes","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristen Shults","x":"…of the legacy Aris and Brazos assets, we continue to expect full year 2026 operation and maintenance expense to increase approximately 25% year-over-year, which is still a meaningful reduction on a combined company basis as we execute on synergy capture and operational cost reduction efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/western-midstream-wes-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,4501,0,0,0,3297,834],[38,1,6495,0,0,0,4281,1753],[39,1,6788,0,0,0,4643,1666],[40,1,4877,0,0,0,3591,968],[41,1,6155,0,0,0,4122,1586],[42,1,6370,0,0,0,4744,1178],[43,1,7603,0,0,0,5468,1645],[44,1,9004,0,0,0,7168,1455],[45,1,5052,0,0,0,3846,909],[46,1,5250,0,0,0,3710,1180],[47,1,4929,0,0,0,3940,739],[62,1,6657,0,0,0,5453,828],[65,1,8674,0,0,0,7668,787],[67,1,6468,0,0,0,5555,663]],"cinema":[[36,1,4501,0,0,0,3297,834],[38,1,6495,0,0,0,4281,1753],[39,1,6788,0,0,0,4643,1666],[40,1,4877,0,0,0,3591,968],[41,1,6155,0,0,0,4122,1586],[42,1,6370,0,0,0,4744,1178],[43,1,7603,0,0,0,5468,1645],[44,1,9004,0,0,0,7168,1455],[45,1,5052,0,0,0,3846,909],[46,1,5250,0,0,0,3710,1180],[47,1,4929,0,0,0,3940,739],[62,1,6657,0,0,0,5453,828],[65,1,8674,0,0,0,7668,787],[67,1,6468,0,0,0,5555,663]],"imax":[[36,1,4